#. type: Content of: <sect2><sect3><title>
#: blfs-en/general/prog/python-modules/pypa-build.xml:92
#, xml-text
msgid "Installation of build"
msgstr "Instalação do build"

#. type: Content of: <sect2><sect3><para>
#: blfs-en/general/prog/python-modules/pypa-build.xml:95
#, xml-text
msgid "Build the package with:"
msgstr "Construa o pacote com:"

#. type: Content of: <sect2><sect3><para>
#: blfs-en/general/prog/python-modules/pypa-build.xml:101
#, xml-text
msgid "To install the package run the following as the &root; user:"
msgstr ""
"Para instalar o pacote execute o seguinte como o(a) usuário(a) &root;:"

#. type: Content of: <sect2><sect3><screen>
#: blfs-en/general/prog/python-modules/pypa-build.xml:104
#, no-wrap, xml-text
msgid "<userinput>&install-wheel; build</userinput>"
msgstr "<userinput>&install-wheel; build</userinput>"

#. type: Content of: <sect2><sect3><para>
#: blfs-en/general/prog/python-modules/pypa-build.xml:107
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"Assuming <xref linkend=\"pytest\"/> is installed and <xref "
"linkend='python3'/> has been rebuilt with <xref linkend='sqlite'/>, but the "
"other optional dependencies are not, the installation can be tested with the"
" following commands:"
msgstr ""
"Assumindo que <xref linkend=\"pytest\"/> esteja instalado e que <xref "
"linkend='python3'/> tenha sido reconstruído com <xref linkend='sqlite'/>, "
"mas as outras dependências opcionais não estejam, a instalação pode ser "
"testada com os seguintes comandos:"

#.  no && because of a possible error
#. type: Content of: <sect2><sect3><screen>
#: blfs-en/general/prog/python-modules/pypa-build.xml:114
#, no-wrap, xml-text
msgid ""
"<userinput>python3 -m venv --system-site-packages testenv &amp;&amp;\n"
"source testenv/bin/activate                    &amp;&amp;\n"
"pip3 install build[test]                       &amp;&amp;\n"
"python3 -m pytest\n"
"deactivate</userinput>"
msgstr ""
"<userinput>python3 -m venv --system-site-packages testenv &amp;&amp;\n"
"source testenv/bin/activate                    &amp;&amp;\n"
"pip3 install build[test]                       &amp;&amp;\n"
"python3 -m pytest\n"
"deactivate</userinput>"

#. type: Content of: <sect2><sect3><para>
#: blfs-en/general/prog/python-modules/pypa-build.xml:121
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"Two tests in <filename>test_self_packaging.py</filename> are known to fail."
msgstr ""
"Dois testes em <filename>test_self_packaging.py</filename> são conhecidos "
"por falharem."

